      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the original test. The class has a lot of unused boilerplate (unused fields with undeclared type `E`, unused utility methods, unused imports) that obscures the actual test logic. I'll write a clean version that keeps only what's needed and improves readability.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version strips away all the unused boilerplate (unused fields with undeclared generic `E`, dozens of utility methods, superfluous imports) and retains only the `IntegerTransformer` inner class and `makeTestCollection()` helper needed by the test, while preserving identical method calls and assertions."
